  (define (even? n)
    (if (= n 0)
        true
        (odd? (- n 1))))
  (define (odd? n)
    (if (= n 0)
        false
        (even? (- n 1))))
  (even? x))
@end lisp

Fill in the missing expressions to complete an alternative definition of
@code{f}, which uses neither internal definitions nor @code{letrec}:

